<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 07-FEB.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 07-FEB.</headline>
<text>
<p>Heavy showers are possible over northeastern Madagascar in association with a tropical disturbance. Flash flooding is possible. This system may develop further during the next 24 hours.  </p>
<p>Strong winds cover much of the northeast Atlantic and the northern North Sea at this time. Shipping in this area is at risk due to high winds and very rough seas. Strong westerly winds may cause wind damage in the British Isles and Scandinavia today.</p>
</text>
